    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_03",
      "hash64": "B1C252ED006DCF24",
      "text": "你在道馆测验中收集\\n向日花怪的样子太厉害了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_04",
      "hash64": "B1C251ED006DCD71",
      "text": "你收集得这么好，\\n向日花怪们也心满意足！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_05",
      "hash64": "B1C250ED006DCBBE",
      "text": "再陪我多收集一下\\n向日花怪，可以吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_06",
      "hash64": "B1C24FED006DCA0B",
      "text": "太好了，就这么向日花了……\\n啊不，是决定了！！\\r\\n大家一定都在微笑着开放呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
